  <TutorialId>k__BackingField: 5
  <TitleLocalizationKey>k__BackingField: tutorial.fishing_rod.title
  <BodyLocalizationKey>k__BackingField: tutorial.fishing_rod.body
  <Title>k__BackingField: Fishing Rod
  <Body>k__BackingField: "Use the Fishing Rod to catch fish from the shore.\n\nHold Left Mouse Button to charge your cast, then release it to cast the line. Longer casts can reach deeper fishing zones and different fish.\n\nWhen a fish bites, hold Left Mouse Button to reel it in. Watch the fish's movement and move your mouse in the opposite direction to keep control of the line. Release the button when necessary to avoid losing the fish.\n\nOnce the fish is caught, press Interact to collect it. Hold Right Mouse Button to cancel the current fishing attempt."
  <VideoClip>k__BackingField: {fileID: 32900000, guid: e667063299fab234caf13c84ff82f034, type: 3}
